This Python wrapper packages the pre-built Java JAR for convenient
pip installation and adds a CLI interface.

This product references publicly available HWP/HWPX file format
specifications published by Hancom Inc. (https://www.hancom.com).

This fork modifies hwplib 1.1.10 HWPReader.java to resolve BinData
compression by storage ID instead of DocInfo list position. The modified
source and rebuild instructions are included in java/ and scripts/.

This fork also modifies hwp2hwpx ForTable.java to preserve and restore
conversion context during recursive nested-table conversion.
